OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry through
OL,6,Fthe evening with largely clear skies
OL,7,Fbut a bit cloudier around the east
OL,8,Fcoast. It will stay dry overnight with
OL,9,Fsome frost in places again.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA chilly but largely sunny
OL,12,Fmorning with an early frost. Becoming
OL,13,Fdull and cloudy from the southeast
OL,14,Fthrough the afternoon with the odd
OL,15,Fspot of light rain possible later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
